.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/rawdata/codex-eval-stdout-iter1.log:993:The wrapper assumed Codex would inherit the parent session's working context (specifically the session ID and the base path). It omitted absolute path discipline in the prompt. Relative paths in Codex invocations are CWD-resolved, and CWD is the Codex sandbox root, not the gobbi session directory. This created a silent path mismatch with no error output, producing a confident but wrong PASS.
