.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/rawdata/codex-eval-stdout-iter1.log:39:# Output (markdown) under worktree: `.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/evaluation/iter1/codex/` — files project.md, structure.md, performance.md, aesthetics.md, usage.md, consistency.md, risk.md, overall.md. Each finding: Type/Severity/Confidence/Evidence(file+line)/Why/Suggested-direction. "No findings"+one line if none. Thresholds: Critical conf>=75→FAIL; High conf>=50→REVISE; else PASS. End overall.md with `VERDICT: PASS|REVISE|FAIL` + Must-preserve list.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/rawdata/codex-eval-stdout-iter1.log:55:In Stage 1 scenarios and checklists are **not separate lists** — each scenario carries an **attached checklist** of concrete yes/no conditions that, if all satisfied, prove the scenario is handled. Adversarial coverage (edge cases / failure modes / attack vectors) is baked into the scenarios at frame-build time, not deferred to a separate adversarial sub-stage. Stage 2 walks each perspective's locked Frame once.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/rawdata/codex-eval-stdout-iter1.log:65:The job of evaluation: **find the problems the creator missed**. It is not a confirmation step. A `PASS` verdict without findings must be defensible — "looks fine" is not a finding.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/rawdata/codex-eval-stdout-iter1.log:105:Review stance is "find ways this will fail". Not "is this good?" — that question collapses into agreement with the creator. A `PASS` verdict that did not actively try to break the artifact is unreliable. **Comfort is a warning sign.** If the agent feels comfortable with the artifact, it has not pushed hard enough.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/sessions/2026-05-24-45388fa9-74a5-42ff-acdf-1308ca35523f/execution/task-07/rawdata/codex-eval-stdout-iter1.log:192:| **How** (no clear approach / first step) | **Continue best-effort.** Record Critical `general` finding (domain: `unevaluable`). Stages 1–3 proceed; per-perspective verdicts inherit at least `REVISE` until How is clarified |
